{"asset_key":"ep1/env_story_11306250","episode":"ep1","category":"env_story","story_id":"11306250","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1130625001:1":{"text":"첫째, 깨끗하고 깔끔하죠! 저희 가게의 모든 침대 시트는 매일 빨아서 말리고 있으니, 먼지는 절대 찾아볼 수 없습니다!","source_cn":"第一，干净、整洁！我们店所有的床单每天都会清洗晾晒！保...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBA0E57A4F7233896","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1130625002:1":{"text":"둘째, 고객 만족 서비스! 모든 직원은 엄격한 트레이닝을 받아, 절대 고객의 사생활을 묻지 않습니다.","source_cn":"第二，服务到位，所有员工都经过严格培训，绝不打听客人们...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x138E4AAF34884B65","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1130625003:1":{"text":"하려는 일이 합법이든, 불법이든 저희는 본 적조차 없는 거죠!","source_cn":"无论你们想做什么，合法的，不合法的，我们都会当做不知道！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9C3D0DE29E58DCBD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:旅店员工阿伦":{"text":"주점 점원 아론","source":"旅店员工阿伦","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":4,"localized_text_count":3,"speaker_count":1}}